Displays:
--------------------------------------------
             - Series 3 Info -

     Disk M:   (free)   xxxxxx (Ram)
     Disk A:   (free)   xxxxxx (Media type)
     Disk B:   (free)   xxxxxx (Media type)
     Rom Version:       1.??F
     Switch off time:   ??? seconds
     New switch off:    ??? seconds
---------------------------------------------

S3info is a utility for getting free memory/Media on all devices.
It's a little faster than using Psion<k> and then pressing
a drive letter at a time, because it displays all the info
on 1 screen. It also uses a couple of Operating system calls
to get the Rom version, and the Auto switch off time.
S3info also lets you adjust the Auto switch off time for the S3.

This is a free utility. Pelican Software Inc. takes no responsibility
for any loss of data, or any other malfunctions due to the use of
S3info, although I have found this utility to work without problem.

                                Mark Esposito
